warning[leaked_allocation]: `parser` holds memory from `New` that is never freed, returned or handed on
  --> tests/lint/leaked_allocation/bad.jai:8:5
   |
 8 |     parser := New(Parser);
   |     ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: free it when done, for example `defer free(parser);` right after this line

warning[leaked_allocation]: `buffer` holds memory from `alloc` that is never freed, returned or handed on
  --> tests/lint/leaked_allocation/bad.jai:12:5
   |
12 |     buffer := cast(*u8) alloc(64);
   |     ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: free it when done, for example `defer free(buffer);` right after this line

warning[leaked_allocation]: `name` holds memory from `copy_string` that is never freed, returned or handed on
  --> tests/lint/leaked_allocation/bad.jai:15:5
   |
15 |     name := copy_string("name");
   |     ^^^^
   |
   = help: free it when done, for example `defer free(name);` right after this line

